<!-- ============================ ABOUT ============================ -->
<section class="section section--tint" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
            <p class="eyebrow">About FIND</p>
            <h2 id="about-heading">What Is OSAS FIND?</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="about-grid">
            <div class="about-text">
                <p>OSAS FIND stands for <strong>Found Item &amp; Notification Desk</strong>. It is a campus-focused lost-and-found system intended to help students and authorized school personnel manage reports of lost and found belongings at Colegio de Montalban.</p>
                <p>Instead of relying on scattered, word-of-mouth searches, OSAS FIND brings lost-and-found concerns into one organized place — so misplaced belongings have a better chance of making their way back to their owners.</p>
            </div>

            <ul class="value-list">
                <li class="value-item">
                    <span class="value-item__icon">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#106a2e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="M15.5 15.5L21 21"/><path d="M7.5 10.5h6M10.5 7.5v6"/></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div>
                        <h3>A convenient place to discover lost and found reports.</h3>
                        <p>Browse current reports from one central location instead of checking multiple places.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="value-item">
                    <span class="value-item__icon">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#106a2e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="5" width="12" height="15" rx="2.5"/><rect x="9.5" y="3" width="5" height="4" rx="1.5"/><path d="M9 11h6M9 14.5h6M9 18h4"/></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div>
                        <h3>A more organized way to submit and review item information.</h3>
                        <p>Structured reports help the right people identify and match belongings more quickly.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="value-item">
                    <span class="value-item__icon">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#106a2e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v18"/><path d="M12 6h7l-2 2.5 2 2.5h-7"/><path d="M8 21h8"/></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div>
                        <h3>A guided claiming process for belongings.</h3>
                        <p>Clear steps walk students through submitting the information needed to establish ownership.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="value-item">
                    <span class="value-item__icon">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#106a2e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 8l8-4 8 4"/><rect x="5" y="8" width="14" height="13" rx="1.5"/><path d="M10 21v-4h4v4"/><path d="M8.5 12h2M13.5 12h2M8.5 15.5h2M13.5 15.5h2"/></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div>
                        <h3>A clearer recovery process coordinated with the appropriate school office.</h3>
                        <p>Authorized personnel review reports and coordinate recovery through the designated school office.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-note">
            <span class="about-note__icon">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#106a2e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 11v5"/><path d="M12 7.5h.01"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div>
                <h3>This website introduces OSAS FIND.</h3>
                <p>To report a lost item, browse found-item reports, or submit a claim, open the FIND mobile application — the operational system where all reporting, searching, and claiming takes place.</p>
                <a class="btn-find btn-find--solid" href="https://portal.cdmconnect.online/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open FIND App</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================ HOW IT WORKS ============================ -->
<section class="section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head section-head--center">
            <p class="eyebrow">How It Works</p>
            <h2 id="how-heading">Recovery in Three Simple Steps</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">The FIND process keeps every step organized and coordinated through the school office.</p>
        </div>

        <ol class="steps">
            <li class="step-card">
                <span class="step-card__number">01</span>
                <span class="step-card__icon">
                    <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#106a2e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="M15.5 15.5L21 21"/></svg>
                </span>
                <h3>Report or Search</h3>
                <p>Students can report a lost item or browse found-item reports using the FIND mobile application.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="step-card">
                <span class="step-card__number">02</span>
                <span class="step-card__icon">
                    <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#106a2e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="5" width="12" height="15" rx="2.5"/><rect x="9.5" y="3" width="5" height="4" rx="1.5"/><path d="M9 11h6M9 14.5h4"/><path d="M14.5 15.5l3 3-4.5 4.5h-3v-3z"/></svg>
                </span>
                <h3>Submit a Claim</h3>
                <p>When a found item matches a student&rsquo;s belongings, the student can submit a claim and provide the required identifying information.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="step-card">
                <span class="step-card__number">03</span>
                <span class="step-card__icon">
                    <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#106a2e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7 2.5v5.5c0 5-3.5 8.5-7 10-3.5-1.5-7-5-7-10V5.5z"/><path d="M9 11.5l2.2 2.2 4-4.5"/></svg>
                </span>
                <h3>Verify and Recover</h3>
                <p>Authorized personnel review claims and coordinate the appropriate recovery process. Approved students follow the instructions provided by the system and the designated school office.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>

        <p class="steps-note">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#5a6b60" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 11v5M12 7.5h.01"/></svg>
            Every step is coordinated with the school office — no private handovers, appointments, or booking is required.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

